        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-12-24/pdf/FR-1986-12-24.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. The heads of Executive departments and agencies m ay determine that  \ncertain offices and installations of their organizations, or parts thereof, must  \nremain open and that certain employees must report for duty on D ecember 26,  \n1986, for reasons of national security or defense or for other public reasons."
