      "text": "Sec. 3. Friday, December 26, 1986, shall be considered as falling within the  \nscope of Executive Order No. 11582 and of 5 U.S.C. 5546 and 6103(b) and other  \nsimilar statutes insofar as they relate to the pay and leave of employees of the  \nUnited States."
